Medical disclaimer

The MIT terms above are the license. The project also keeps this non-medical
disclaimer, which is not a modification of those terms:

This is an educational planning tool, not medical advice. Capsule caffeine
values vary by market, batch, recipe, and source; use manual overrides when
your sleeve or product page provides a better value. The graph reference line
is a user planning marker, not a universal sleep cutoff.

This caffeine curve is an educational planning estimate, not medical advice,
diagnosis, or treatment. Individual metabolism can vary widely; use manual
overrides and consult a clinician for health-specific questions.
